{
  "description": "合流：会话开始时注入「你在哪个分支、对应哪张功能卡、预约哪一版、落后多少」；会话每轮结束时把最后活动记进本机缓存。入口 bin/heliu-hook 是 sh 包装，自己找 bun，不依赖 PATH。不注册 WorktreeCreate（该事件会替换 Claude Code 默认的 worktree 创建，heliu 不代建 worktree）。",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/heliu-hook",
            "args": [],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/heliu-hook",
            "args": [],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
